{
 "total": 39.813,
 "frases": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "a": 0.15,
   "b": 2.23,
   "texto": "Your ladder is about to slide right out from under you!",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "a": 2.38,
   "b": 4.729,
   "texto": "Hit like and follow. Flo thinks flatter is safer!",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "a": 4.849,
   "b": 8.405,
   "texto": "Flatter is safer! It can't tip over if it's almost lying down!",
   "h": 1
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "a": 8.525,
   "b": 11.285,
   "texto": "Too flat, and the feet kick out. You ride it down the wall.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "a": 11.405,
   "b": 12.935,
   "texto": "Then I'll stand it straight up!",
   "h": 1
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "a": 13.035,
   "b": 15.617,
   "texto": "Too steep, and you tip over backward. Even worse.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "a": 15.767,
   "b": 17.133,
   "texto": "So what's the magic angle?",
   "h": 1
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "a": 17.233,
   "b": 20.666,
   "texto": "The four to one rule. For every four feet up, the feet go one foot out.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "a": 20.786,
   "b": 22.991,
   "texto": "Ten feet up to the gutter? Two and a half feet out.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "a": 23.141,
   "b": 27.051,
   "texto": "Quick check: toes at the feet, arms straight out. Your hands should land on a rung.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "a": 27.171,
   "b": 30.307,
   "texto": "Climbing onto a roof? Let it stick up three feet past the edge.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "a": 30.457,
   "b": 33.395,
   "texto": "Fine. Four to one. I'll even count my steps.",
   "h": 1
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "a": 33.595,
   "b": 37.512,
   "texto": "Ladder angle. Flatter is safer, or four to one? Team Norm or Team Flo?",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "a": 37.712,
   "b": 39.813,
   "texto": "Follow for more backyard builds that won't fail!",
   "h": 0
  }
 ],
